  "notes": "USAGE:\n{阻害|そがい} is a formal word used in written language, news, academic papers, and official reports. In medicine and biochemistry, it means \"inhibition\" (e.g., enzyme inhibition).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {成長|せいちょう}を{阻害|そがい}する (to hinder growth)\n- {発展|はってん}を{阻害|そがい}する (to obstruct development)\n- {阻害|そがい}{要因|よういん} (obstructing factor)\n- {阻害|そがい}{剤|ざい} (inhibitor — medical/chemical term)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {阻害|そがい}: obstruction (formal; blocking progress or processes)\n- {疎外|そがい}: alienation, exclusion (homophone, different kanji — being socially excluded)\n- {妨害|ぼうがい}: interference, obstruction (deliberately getting in the way)\n- {障害|しょうがい}: obstacle, disability (a thing that blocks)",
